{"name":"Catholic Study Bible","short_name":"Catholic Study Bible","description":"The Bible in its original languages, in Catholic order: every Greek and Hebrew word tagged with its translation in the verse, its definition, and synonyms — the sixty-six books carried over whole, with the deuterocanon in Greek from Swete's Septuagint, beginning with Tobit. Public-domain sources only.","lang":"en","start_url":".","scope":".","display":"standalone","background_color":"#f6f4ef","theme_color":"#16171b","icons":[{"src":"icon-192.png","sizes":"192x192","type":"image/png","purpose":"any"},{"src":"icon-512.png","sizes":"512x512","type":"image/png","purpose":"any"},{"src":"icon-512.png","sizes":"512x512","type":"image/png","purpose":"maskable"}]}